- In the direct branch, the enemy front may not be empty but targets empty? targets only targetable when enemy front cards exist; if no front cards, direct. Good.
- The while loop `turns<40` counts player turns. AI turn may take up to ~5s; total ~40 * 6 = 240s > shell timeout. Limit to 15 turns (~90s). Use timeout 180s? Shell max 120s default; can set 300000. Fine.
- `turn()` returns "KAI'S TURN" during enemy; wait.
