- At loop condition, if overlay not yet up, `over()` false; but turn is "DUEL OVER"; waits. Good.
- The game could last >15 turns; fine.
- Auto-play may spend all AP but not end turn because `maybeAutoEnd` triggers; we then check turn and if still player click end turn. If auto-end already triggered, turn may be enemy; skip.
- Hand click on unaffordable disabled; we check cost.
- If hand card is selected but no legal zone due to front full/back full, clicking again deselects; fine.
